{"id":"live-20261117-122308","title":"A Little Stillness","dur":175.22,"events":[{"type":"state","text":"Getting the workshop ready","t":0},{"type":"look","to":"front","t":0.35},{"type":"say","key":"live-20261117-122308.plan","f":"live/audio/live-20261117-122308.plan.ogg","d":5.44,"text":"Build a warm candle and brass saucer against a quiet blue night, using stepped shapes and small highlights.","t":0.35},{"type":"state","text":"Quinn tells where the idea came from","t":7.78},{"type":"say","key":"live-20261117-122308.insp","f":"live/audio/live-20261117-122308.insp.ogg","d":9.39,"text":"This piece draws from the intimate glow of candlelit rooms and the simple shapes of vintage game scenery. Its deep blues and warm golds suggest a peaceful evening beside a window.","t":9.33},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 1 of 64","t":22.84},{"type":"say","key":"live-20261117-122308.s1.1","f":"live/audio/live-20261117-122308.s1.1.ogg","d":6.47,"text":"I’ll lay in the room with SOLID shapes, using navy and blue for quiet darkness and muted brown for a gentle halo.","t":23.25},{"type":"state","text":"Quinn explains what comes next","t":23.25},{"type":"state","text":"Quinn measures","t":31.71},{"type":"state","text":"Quinn measures","t":34.46},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 2 of 64","t":36.11},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 3 of 64","t":36.54},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 4 of 64","t":36.98},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 5 of 64","t":37.39},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 6 of 64","t":37.81},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 7 of 64","t":38.25},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 8 of 64","t":38.65},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 9 of 64","t":39.06},{"type":"say","key":"live-20261117-122308.s1.9","f":"live/audio/live-20261117-122308.s1.9.ogg","d":6.96,"text":"With short LINE strokes, I’ll give the orange flame a leaning tip and a broad lower belly so it feels gently alive.","t":39.48},{"type":"state","text":"Quinn explains what comes next","t":39.48},{"type":"state","text":"Quinn measures","t":48.17},{"type":"state","text":"Quinn measures","t":50.91},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 10 of 64","t":52.56},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 11 of 64","t":53.02},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 12 of 64","t":53.42},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 13 of 64","t":53.83},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 14 of 64","t":54.23},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 15 of 64","t":54.69},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 16 of 64","t":55.1},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 17 of 64","t":55.52},{"type":"say","key":"live-20261117-122308.s1.17","f":"live/audio/live-20261117-122308.s1.17.ogg","d":7.17,"text":"I’ll nest yellow and cream inside the flame with LINE and PEN, then add a charcoal wick to anchor that brightness.","t":55.92},{"type":"state","text":"Quinn explains what comes next","t":55.92},{"type":"state","text":"Quinn measures","t":64.91},{"type":"bg","cat":"hum","vol":0.45,"t":66.58},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 18 of 64","t":66.59},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 19 of 64","t":67.05},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 20 of 64","t":67.49},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 21 of 64","t":67.9},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 22 of 64","t":68.36},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 23 of 64","t":68.78},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 24 of 64","t":69.2},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 25 of 64","t":69.6},{"type":"react","cat":"hmm","t":70.03},{"type":"say","key":"live-20261117-122308.s1.25","f":"live/audio/live-20261117-122308.s1.25.ogg","d":7.66,"text":"I’ll use SOLID blocks for the wax pillar, keeping its left side cream and its right side ochre to show where the light falls.","t":71.55},{"type":"state","text":"Quinn explains what comes next","t":71.55},{"type":"state","text":"Quinn measures","t":81.11},{"type":"state","text":"Quinn measures","t":83.88},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 26 of 64","t":85.53},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 27 of 64","t":85.96},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 28 of 64","t":86.4},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 29 of 64","t":86.85},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 30 of 64","t":87.29},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 31 of 64","t":87.74},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 32 of 64","t":88.15},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 33 of 64","t":88.56},{"type":"react","cat":"hmm","t":89.05},{"type":"say","key":"live-20261117-122308.s1.33","f":"live/audio/live-20261117-122308.s1.33.ogg","d":8.28,"text":"Using LINE and SOLID, I’ll shape the melted rim and a few hanging drips; pale yellow catches the light while brown marks the hollow.","t":90.38},{"type":"state","text":"Quinn explains what comes next","t":90.38},{"type":"state","text":"Quinn measures","t":100.54},{"type":"state","text":"Quinn measures","t":103.35},{"type":"bg","cat":"hum","vol":0.45,"t":105},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 34 of 64","t":105.01},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 35 of 64","t":105.44},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 36 of 64","t":105.85},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 37 of 64","t":106.28},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 38 of 64","t":106.7},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 39 of 64","t":107.12},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 40 of 64","t":107.52},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 41 of 64","t":107.97},{"type":"say","key":"live-20261117-122308.s1.41","f":"live/audio/live-20261117-122308.s1.41.ogg","d":6.3,"text":"I’ll finish the wax with small PEN and LINE marks, letting cream drip tips stand apart from their brown shadows.","t":108.37},{"type":"state","text":"Quinn explains what comes next","t":108.37},{"type":"state","text":"Quinn measures","t":116.47},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 42 of 64","t":118.14},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 43 of 64","t":118.57},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 44 of 64","t":119.01},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 45 of 64","t":119.42},{"type":"look","to":"room","t":119.85},{"type":"state","text":"Quinn takes a closer look","t":119.86},{"type":"look","to":"front","t":122.51},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 46 of 64","t":123.45},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 47 of 64","t":123.94},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 48 of 64","t":124.36},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 49 of 64","t":124.75},{"type":"react","cat":"hmm","t":125.18},{"type":"say","key":"live-20261117-122308.s1.49","f":"live/audio/live-20261117-122308.s1.49.ogg","d":6.14,"text":"I’ll build a low brass saucer with LINE strokes, using gold along its rim and deep brown underneath to give it weight.","t":126.66},{"type":"state","text":"Quinn explains what comes next","t":126.66},{"type":"state","text":"Quinn measures","t":134.55},{"type":"state","text":"Quinn measures","t":137.35},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 50 of 64","t":139},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 51 of 64","t":139.44},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 52 of 64","t":139.89},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 53 of 64","t":140.32},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 54 of 64","t":140.72},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 55 of 64","t":141.14},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 56 of 64","t":141.56},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 57 of 64","t":142.01},{"type":"say","key":"live-20261117-122308.s1.57","f":"live/audio/live-20261117-122308.s1.57.ogg","d":7.68,"text":"I’ll add the final glints with PEN and LINE, keeping the cream reflections small and the blue window marks subdued so the flame stays brightest.","t":142.47},{"type":"state","text":"Quinn explains what comes next","t":142.47},{"type":"state","text":"Quinn measures","t":152.25},{"type":"bg","cat":"hum","vol":0.45,"t":153.89},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 58 of 64","t":153.89},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 59 of 64","t":154.3},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 60 of 64","t":154.73},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 61 of 64","t":155.13},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 62 of 64","t":155.58},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 63 of 64","t":155.98},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 64 of 64","t":156.37},{"type":"look","to":"room","t":156.79},{"type":"state","text":"Quinn turns the screen to herself to look at her work","t":156.79},{"type":"say","key":"live-20261117-122308.end","f":"live/audio/live-20261117-122308.end.ogg","d":10.04,"text":"The stepped flame and pale wax stand clearly against the dark room, while the shallow brass saucer gives the candle a grounded silhouette. The small drip shapes add texture without competing with the light.","t":160.32},{"type":"state","text":"Quinn looks at it and thinks it over","t":160.32},{"type":"look","to":"front","t":173.27},{"type":"state","text":"Finished.","t":173.27},{"type":"rate","stars":"★★★★☆","html":"<div><b>Matches my plan: </b>yes</div><div><b>Best part: </b>luminous flame and melted rim</div><div><b>Next time: </b>soften the square halo with more stepped edges</div>","t":174.82}]}